    {
      "id": "song-111",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "眼儿媚",
      "subtitle": "杨柳丝丝弄轻柔",
      "author": "王雱",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "杨柳丝丝弄轻柔，烟缕织成愁。海棠未雨，梨花先雪，一半春休。\n而今往事难重省，归梦绕秦楼。相思只在：丁香枝上，豆蔻梢头。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "96f1004327fe7db4174970591cab39e4fa9f75c0f867167797ce92f9347a86ca",
      "estimatedOutput": 718,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-111--96f1004327fe7db4174970591cab39e4fa9f75c0f867167797ce92f9347a86ca.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-112",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "生查子",
      "subtitle": "独游雨岩",
      "author": "辛弃疾",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "溪边照影行，天在清溪底。天上有行云，人在行云里。 \n高歌谁和余，空谷清音起。非鬼亦非仙，一曲桃花水。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "09c78c0002fe91818f1440226deb955618ba5e40b2bee19da10a482838aa1ac2",
      "estimatedOutput": 700,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-112--09c78c0002fe91818f1440226deb955618ba5e40b2bee19da10a482838aa1ac2.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-113",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "如梦令",
      "subtitle": "道是梨花不是",
      "author": "严蕊",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "道是梨花不是。\n道是杏花不是。\n白白与红红，别是东风情味。\n曾记，曾记，人在武陵微醉。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "df3a87d939101756274b2e56b01f79f9f7f309bb772b5ef3ac84a7df538813a5",
      "estimatedOutput": 686,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-113--df3a87d939101756274b2e56b01f79f9f7f309bb772b5ef3ac84a7df538813a5.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-114",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "更漏子",
      "subtitle": "柳丝长",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "柳丝长，桃叶小。深院断无人到。红日淡，绿烟晴。流莺三两声。 \n雪香浓，檀晕少。枕上卧枝花好。春思重，晓妆迟。寻思残梦时。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "d20d9bc19c3c5801448f5cfa030432c0c4a65a13b09fbf39cbff51141f768388",
      "estimatedOutput": 720,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-114--d20d9bc19c3c5801448f5cfa030432c0c4a65a13b09fbf39cbff51141f768388.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-115",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "清平乐",
      "subtitle": "采芳人杳",
      "author": "张炎",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "采芳人杳，顿觉游情少。客里看春多草草，总被诗愁分了。\n去年燕子天涯，今年燕子谁家？ 三月休听夜雨，如今不是催花。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "8e66c51f1c84ea7f9ceee6635536ca4f7bdfd1c31aeaf2377a2d8b571a00a35b",
      "estimatedOutput": 712,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-115--8e66c51f1c84ea7f9ceee6635536ca4f7bdfd1c31aeaf2377a2d8b571a00a35b.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-116",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "浣溪沙",
      "subtitle": "送梅庭老赴上党学官",
      "author": "苏轼",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "门外东风雪洒裾，山头回首望三吴。不应弹铗为无鱼。\n上党从来天下脊，先生元是古之儒。时平不用鲁连书。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "63c70e22e06b480a6e6f7461fd02015347afdb33366fe5b668a289d5da284395",
      "estimatedOutput": 698,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-116--63c70e22e06b480a6e6f7461fd02015347afdb33366fe5b668a289d5da284395.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-117",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "长相思",
      "subtitle": "长相思",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "长相思，长相思。若问相思甚了期，除非相见时。\n长相思，长相思。欲把相思说似谁，浅情人不知。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "f89906529063da7be68f77ab17da7f535bd7ab166b0dacc5e29f6a53aa7065ff",
      "estimatedOutput": 690,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-117--f89906529063da7be68f77ab17da7f535bd7ab166b0dacc5e29f6a53aa7065ff.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-118",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "长相思",
      "subtitle": "雨",
      "author": "万俟咏",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "一声声，一更更。窗外芭蕉窗里灯，此时无限情。\n梦难成，恨难平。不道愁人不喜听，空阶滴到明。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e8943d623a73819c2addf5a234d93a2f00295306a4c21b582e8727fe54e5ee92",
